<%= header_section(@subject) %>
<div>
  <p>
    Your report about <strong><%= @product_name %></strong> passed our review.
  </p>
  <p>
    The notice below is what we will send to the site hosting the copy, on your behalf. Read it before
    you sign it:
  </p>
  <p>
    <%= link_to "Review and sign the notice", @sign_url, class: "button primary" %>
  </p>
  <p>
    Once you sign, we send the notice from support@gumroad.com with you in CC, and we email you again
    when the site responds.
  </p>
</div>
